              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "عزز — ʿazzaza — \"to strengthen\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "عززت الرياضة ثقته بنفسه. ʿazzazat ar-riyāḍa thiqatahu bi-nafsih. Sport strengthened his self-confidence."
            },
