          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "عزز (ʿazzaza) is built on the native Arabic root ʿ-z-z, \"to be strong, mighty\" (Lane). It is Form II, to make strong: to strengthen, to reinforce."
            }
          ]
